13285      /* STAT-CAUSALMED-002: CAUSALMED — Causal mediation effect estimation
13286       * Source: S154 / Chapter 38 / `Getting Started: CAUSALMED Procedure` (PDF pp. 2368–2372); S154 / Chapter 38 / `Overview: CAUSALMED Procedure` (PDF
13286    !  pp. 2364–2368).
